  "_readme": [
    "Curated sources for the menu photography that ships with the app.",
    "Every photograph is a freely-licensed Wikimedia Commons file (CC0, public",
    "domain, CC BY or CC BY-SA) chosen by eye to match the dish it is used for.",
    "`name` must match the seed menu item exactly (src/shared/menu-data.ts) —",
    "that is how images are attached at seed time.",
    "Run `node scripts/build-menu-images.mjs --force` after editing; it fills in",
    "artist/license/page and writes manifest.json plus the 500x375 .webp files."
